/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_DspCore DspCore
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Lookup tables, interpolation, generators, filters and transforms.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | Portable signal processing without MIDI or music-theory concepts |
 * | Current release | [`v0.1.1`](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/DspCore/releases/tag/v0.1.1) |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/DspCore](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/DspCore) |
 * | Runtime dependencies | Foundation `2.0.5` or a newer 2.x release |
 * | Public CMake target | `DspCore::DspCore` |
 *
 * DspCore takes over the signal-processing module that lived inside legacy
 * MIDILAR. It is built phase by phase on the same pinned RoModularBuild
 * `v0.4.0` as Foundation and MCC, and MIDILAR consumes it starting with DspCore
 * `v0.1.1`, which also supports stock Arduino C++11 source builds.
 */
